Those are certainly not high enough.

You need a monster whose value is higher than 12 for chaotic characters,
or 8 for non-chaotics. The value starts at the monster's rating (DIF in
the second monster spoiler) plus one; a jackal's value is 1 and a
hobgoblin's is 4. Unicorns can get a bonus.
If you're neutral, a panther, large cat, vampire bat, owlbear,
crocodile, and others of that difficulty, would do; because of the
bonus, so does a cross-aligned unicorn. If you're chaotic, you're going
to need at least a winged gargoyle, giant mimic, fire giant, or
elvenking. (And since you got Magicbane, you can't be lawful, but the
numbers would be the same as for neutral if you were.)

